{"screen_name": "super_tokagen", "file": "super_tokagen", "name": "とかげんさん2", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1789424942490234880/joypSZIc.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/970308783787294726/1653033423/1500x500", "description": "社会的なはいしゃさん 愚痴と下書きと没絵と趣味 \n本垢 @hatyuuruinohito\n本垢用skeb→http://skeb.jp/@super_tokagen", "total_works": 227, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T07:54:25.288392+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 15000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00"}, {"amount": 15000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-14T11:09:56.234744"}, {"amount": 15000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-27T00:58:00.493156"}, {"amount": 15000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-10T18:57:01.891235"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 15000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 15000, "max": 15000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/super_tokagen", "name": "super_tokagen"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@super_tokagen/works/227", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0e00ed23/uploads/origins/36f25835-caae-45d3-9bbc-b6f7dbfcd9ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec90f010157b75a455ccd360c83b4bdc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0e00ed23/uploads/origins/36f25835-caae-45d3-9bbc-b6f7dbfcd9ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec90f010157b75a455ccd360c83b4bdc, https://si.imgix.net/0e00ed23/uploads/origins/36f25835-caae-45d3-9bbc-b6f7dbfcd9ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff4d08a78810d0b52a46601ce40fc35a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0e00ed23/uploads/origins/36f25835-caae-45d3-9bbc-b6f7dbfcd9ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52924c50f73cf548d2f054f22d673c88 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの作品に描かれるイラストや表情がとても好きです！もしよろしければ、私のVTuberキャラクターのエモートセットを依頼したいのですが！彼女はサイボー