me expressions!\n\nUsage:\nI want to be able to use them for my Vtubing Activities! (Social Media, Youtube, Twitch, Discord etc.)\nIf possible, Id also love to get merchendising rights!\n\nI hope the amount I sent is enough!\n\nCharacter:\nMy Vtuber!\nShe is a smug, tsundere, delinquent tomboy fox girl!\nShe hates losing in games (she will cry) but pretends she is the best at them!\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ur1539EqwlOejoT-yJjE8bmLoyUSBWeM?usp=sharing\n\nPose:\nSuper happy sparkly eyes\nVery smug\nConfused ????\nFace down Dead on the floor (tail up) (can be black and white!)\nProtesting in embarrassment \nReading BL (straight face)\nlosing a game, throwing controller (really angry)\nSoul (not the mascot!) leaving body\nMiddle Finger, swearing\nShocked ?!\nCrying  \nHolding bat into camera (threat)\nPeace (maybe her mascot is next to her)\nEmpty wallet\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ur1539EqwlOejoT-yJjE8bmLoyUSBWeM?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@super_tokagen/works/198", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f1def766/uploads/origins/4199e54f-df01-4c38-9441-9174689bb6a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=579c1d99d06d4ba6a1b0109e80ba79d1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f1def766/uploads/origins/4199e54f-df01-4c38-9441-9174689bb6a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=579c1d99d06d4ba6a1b0109e80ba79d1, https://si.imgix.net/f1def766/uploads/origins/4199e54f-df01-4c38-9441-9174689bb6a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=33da7a8cefd45f622d1546f60c0bf7e3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f1def766/uploads/origins/4199e54f-df01-4c38-9441-9174689bb6a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54c88c22cb0b976f1b151942cdd66025 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、桃花源さん。あなたのステッカーイラストが大好きで、ずっと依頼したいと思っていました。25枚のステッカーが欲しいのですが、この値段では無理でしたら、必要な金額を送ってください。\n